  "id": "3981539f504d2f59",
  "text": "Eleanor McLellan-Lemala, Stacie R. Deatonb,*, Joshua E. Bettsb, Ken Ondengec, Victor Mudhunec, Siobhan M. O’Connora, Beatrice Nyagolc, Andrea R. Thurmand, Gustavo F. Donceld, Shannon A. Allene, Renee Heffronf, Nelly R. Mugof,g, Kisumu Combined Ring",
